# Copy the value into Coolify's Environment Variables for the resource.
# Generate a strong one, e.g.:  openssl rand -base64 24
# SQL Server / Azure SQL Edge rejects weak passwords (needs upper, lower,
# digit/symbol, 8+ chars), and the API won't connect if this differs from
# what the sqledge container was FIRST created with.
MSSQL_SA_PASSWORD=change-me-to-a-strong-secret
